{"title":"Image","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> be <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Set\" title=\"Set\">sets</a>, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/9/399793119a92a42a51b443c2ddb9f2170faa5c9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:A\\to B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" /> be a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Function\" title=\"Function\">function</a>. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/e/3dec8d8a153d718520883eb1ec5dc5ba3646f413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{f(a):a\\in A\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" /> is called the <b>image</b> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Image&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Surjection\" title=\"Surjection\">surjection</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Image&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018090942\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: fa